          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mumuyika kwamakhumi kataru namusaafu kwobwarwi bwaYehoyakhini omuruchi waYuda, mumwesi kwekhumi nakhabili, nikuli amakhumi kabili nakharaano, Ewili-merodakhi omuruchi waBabeli mumuyika okwambeli kwoburuchibwe, yaboholola Yehoyakhini omuruchi waYuda, namurusia mumbohe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "namusunjila akeshisa, nara eshifumbishie emukulu webifumbi biabaruchi aba yali ninabo eBabeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Yehoyakhini nakalukhasia tsingubotsie tsiobubohe; ne naliitsanga khumeesa yomuruchi tsindaalo tsiosi tsiobulamubwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khulwa omukabokwe, yakabilungwa buli nyanga nomuruchi waBabeli omukabo nalebe buli nyanga okhuula khunyanga yokhufwakhwe, tsindaalo tsiosi tsiobulamubwe.",
          "type": "text",
